{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras/87317f84fc7b4b5538b4acd69d08122a.poster.avif?t=1757455008\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras/87317f84fc7b4b5538b4acd69d08122a.webm?t=1757455008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras/87317f84fc7b4b5538b4acd69d08122a.mp4?t=1757455008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOOST YOUR DREAMS !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Nikko, a young squirrel girl on a journey through visions of her future ! <br>Explore levels at brisk speed using you <i>BOOST!</i> and collect every sun in this retro-styled adventure paying hommage to the greatest late-90's classics !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras/91d921fe1c9a0d6b6b3db922dce95cf2.avif?t=1757455008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras_big/91d921fe1c9a0d6b6b3db922dce95cf2.webp?t=1757455008 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER NIKKO'S FATE !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nikko is going through the stages of her life to come, trying to piece together a prophecy that could change the universe !</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>4 worlds</strong> filled with little secrets !</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through <strong>20+ levels</strong> with a variety of gameplays !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle <strong>5+ bosses</strong> that will test your skills !\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy exploring with\u00a0<strong>4 playable characters</strong> !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras/804b17d8254ed8a31307e76ccf8ca961.avif?t=1757455008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras_big/804b17d8254ed8a31307e76ccf8ca961.webp?t=1757455008 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DREAM IN DUO !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pop-in a second player at anytime through the pause meny with the Nikko-op feature !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your dreams with a bestie !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras/ace9349a3dcabec79a74d5ee4bb212bf.avif?t=1757455008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/extras_big/ace9349a3dcabec79a74d5ee4bb212bf.webp?t=1757455008 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987090?t=1757455008","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987090?t=1757455008","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/8cf4a00017e47485af3bc44c3d1d95934a937734/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757455008","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987090/8cf4a00017e47485af3bc44c3d1d95934a937734/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757455008","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"C